{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2023-04-24 09:00:00', 'title': 'IBM TO HELP SUPPORT NYSE LISTED COMPANIES WITH THEIR ESG EFFORTS', 'text': 'ARMONK, N.Y. , APRIL 24, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- IBM (NYSE: IBM) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT IS COLLABORATING WITH THE NEW YORK STOCK EXCHANGE (NYSE), PART OF INTERCONTINENTAL EXCHANGE, INC. (NYSE: ICE), A LEADING GLOBAL PROVIDER OF DATA, TECHNOLOGY, AND MARKET INFRASTRUCTURE, TO HELP SUPPORT NYSE-LISTED COMPANIES WITH THEIR ENVIRONMENTAL, SOCIAL, AND GOVERNANCE (ESG) EFFORTS.'}